    fix(web): draw an unchanged experiment metric as neutral
    
    An experiment metric whose after equals its before drew a green down
    arrow in its stat panel and a red mean-after line in its chart. It now
    reads '= vs <before> before' with no delta class, and the mean-after
    line is stroked var(--text-muted).
    
    Task-Id: 16

